  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The development, by virtue of its design, scale and siting, will provide for an overly dominant and out of character addition and one that does not relate to the architectural style of the locally listed host building. This is considered harmful to the character and appearance of no. 267 High Road, the wider streetscene and conservation area in which it is located. It is therefore contrary to the design objectives of Policies 53, 72 and 75 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
